  "text": "I'll start by reading the implementer brief, the existing `index.html`, and the house-style CSS so `styles.css` matches both the spec and the markup that's already here.The brief and markup are in. Next I’ll pull the brand/layout details from the plan and the existing modal/toast classes so the stylesheet covers both current shell and later chunks.I have the spec, the live markup, and the house-style envelope. Next I’ll write a complete `styles.css` that covers every required class plus the shell classes already in `index.html`.The stylesheet is on disk. I’ll scan it now so the report lists every token, class, and breakpoint against the brief.`styles.css` is written. The other four Chunk 1 files were left untouched. Visual checks are left to the reviewer, per the no-shell constraint.\n\n---\n\n### 1. Custom properties in `:root`\n\n**Brand**\n- `--brand-navy` `#062448`\n- `--brand-navy-2` `#14294d`\n- `--brand-red` `#a3301f`\n- `--brand-red-2` `#8d2418`\n- `--brand-cream` `#f6f3ec`\n- `--brand-white` `#ffffff`\n- `--ink-muted` `#4a5568`\n\n**Teaching (field diagrams only)**\n- `--teach-ball` `#dc2626`\n- `--teach-base` `#facc15`\n- `--teach-backup` `#16a34a`\n- `--teach-unit-if` `#0d9488`\n- `--teach-unit-of` `#ea580c`\n- `--teach-battery` `#374151`\n\n**Surfaces / chrome**\n- `--color-bg`, `--color-surface`, `--color-surface-alt`, `--color-border`, `--color-text`, `--color-muted`, `--color-primary`, `--color-primary-hover`, `--color-accent`, `--color-accent-hover`\n\n**Radii / shadows / type / space**\n- `--radius`, `--radius-lg`, `--shadow-card`, `--shadow-pop`\n- `--text-xs`, `--text-sm`, `--text-base`, `--text-md`, `--text-lg`, `--text-xl`, `--text-2xl`, `--text-3xl`\n- `--space-1` … `--space-8`, `--maxw`\n\n**Six tier accents (navy → red; each is contrast-safe for white text)**\n- `--tier-rookie` `#0a3d6b`\n- `--tier-sandlot` `#062448`\n- `--tier-diamond` `#14294d`\n- `--tier-select` `#4a2040`\n- `--tier-elite` `#8d2418`\n- `--tier-promind` `#a3301f`\n\nNo extra tokens beyond the brief’s `:root` block plus those six tier accents.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Class selectors, by area\n\n**Chrome (all requested)**  \n`.skip-link`, `.app-bar`, `.app-logo`, `.app-bar-title`, `.app-bar-sub`, `.app-nav`, `.nav-btn`, `.nav-btn.active`, `.nav-btn-readme`, `.app-footer`, `.view`, `.view.active`\n\n**Home (all requested)**  \n`.hero`, `.hero-crest`, `.hero-title`, `.hero-motto`, `.hero-actions`, `.continue-card`, `.tier-rail`, `.tier-rail-item`, `.quick-links`, `.quick-link-card`\n\n**Path (all requested)**  \n`.tier-accordion`, `.tier-head`, `.tier-head.open`, `.tier-body`, `.tier-ring`, `.chapter-grid`, `.chapter-card`, `.chapter-card.complete`, `.chapter-card.recommended`, `.chapter-card.visited`, `.chapter-card-meta`, `.chapter-badge`, `.score-pill`\n\n**Chapter reader (all requested)**  \n`.chapter-header`, `.chapter-objectives`, `.chapter-progress`, `.section`, `.section-heading`, `.section-prose`, `.section-diagram`, `.diagram-caption`, `.keypoints`, `.keypoints li`, `.coachnote`, `.example-box`, `.divisionnote`, `.divisionnote table`, `.terms-row`, `.term-btn`, `.chapter-nav`, `.chapter-cta`\n\n**Quiz / IQ (all requested)**  \n`.quiz-shell`, `.quiz-progress-dots`, `.quiz-dot`, `.quiz-dot.correct`, `.quiz-dot.wrong`, `.quiz-dot.current`, `.quiz-prompt`, `.choice-list`, `.choice-btn`, `.choice-btn.selected`, `.choice-btn.correct`, `.choice-btn.wrong`, `.quiz-explain`, `.quiz-result`, `.score-ring`, `.bbiq-score`, `.bbiq-band`, `.topic-breakdown`, `.answer-review`\n\n**Widgets (all requested)**  \n`.widget`, `.widget-head`, `.widget-body`, `.widget-actions`, `.widget-status`, `.token`, `.token.selected`, `.token.placed`, `.dropzone`, `.dropzone.over`, `.dropzone.correct`, `.dropzone.wrong`\n\n**Generic (all requested)**  \n`.btn`, `.btn-primary`, `.btn-accent`, `.btn-ghost`, `.btn-sm`, `.card`, `.panel`, `.pill`, `.badge-rosette`, `.hint`, `.visually-hidden`, `.empty-state`, `.progress-bar`, `.progress-bar-fill`, `.toast`\n\n**Requested classes not defined:** none.\n\n**Added, not in the brief — live markup in `index.html`**  \n`.home-body`, `.hero-inner`, `.quick-link-title`, `.quick-link-blurb`, `.readme-content`, `.readme-section`, `.help-values`, `.help-value`, `.help-value-icon`, `.help-value-name`, `.roots-list`, `.help-roots-img`, `.app-footer-name`, `.app-footer-version`, `.app-footer-link`, `.no-print`, `.nav-btn-readme.active`\n\n**Added — already emitted by shipped JS / `changelog.html`**  \n`.btn-secondary`, `.hidden`, `.modal-overlay`, `.modal-box`, `.modal-title`, `.modal-actions`, `body.modal-open`, `.feedback-rating`, `.star-rating`, `.star-btn`, `.star-btn.star-on`, `.star-rating-label`, `.feedback-intro`, `.feedback-form`, `.feedback-field`, `.feedback-counter`, `.feedback-error`, `.feedback-confirm`, `.feedback-confirm-note`, `.feedback-truncated-note`, `.feedback-address-line`, `.feedback-email`, `.feedback-fallback-text`, `.whatsnew-subtitle`, `.whatsnew-list`, `.whatsnew-history-link`, `.update-lead`, `.update-reassure`, `.update-status`, `.changelog-page`, `.changelog-intro`, `.changelog-current`, `.changelog-back`, `.changelog-entry`, `.changelog-version`, `.changelog-badge`, `.changelog-badge-major`, `.changelog-badge-minor`, `.changelog-date`, `.changelog-title`, `.changelog-highlights`\n\n**Added — forward-looking for later chunks**  \n`.tier-rookie`, `.tier-sandlot`, `.tier-diamond`, `.tier-select`, `.tier-elite`, `.tier-promind`, `.tier-accordion.open`  \n(plus `[data-tier=\"…\"]` attribute selectors, not classes)\n\n---\n\n### 3. Breakpoints\n\n| Query | Role |\n|---|---|\n| `@media screen` | Sticky footer column layout |\n| `@media (min-width: 768px)` | Required split: two-column path/chapter, three-up quick-links, nav right-aligned |\n| `@media (min-width: 1024px)` | Extra: 3-column chapter grid, larger hero type |\n| `@media (max-width: 767px)` | Single column, stacked hero actions, tighter padding |\n| `@media (max-width: 479px)` | Extra: full-width tier-rail items, changelog date wrap |\n| `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` | Disable transitions/animations (mirrored on `body.reduced-motion`) |\n| `@media print` | Hide chrome; chapter `.section` page-breaks; diagrams fit page width |\n\n---\n\n### 4. Deviations\n\n- Extra classes as listed above so existing `index.html`, `changelog.html`, `uiModal.js`, `feedback.js`, and `appUpdates.js` are not unstyled, and so later chunks can colour-code tiers without inline styles.\n- Extra breakpoints `1024px` and `479px` on top of the required 768px split.\n- App-bar crest is 64×64 (brand minimum), not the practice-app’s 44px.\n- Interactive controls are 44×44 including footer links and `.btn-sm`; `.term-btn` and non-button `.quiz-dot` indicators are the exceptions the brief allows.\n- Image URLs are only `brand/diamond-golden-hour.jpg` (hero) and `brand/pattern-brand-tile.jpg` (hero texture at ~8% opacity). No external URLs.\n- Teaching hex values are applied only under `.section-diagram` via `[data-role]` / `[data-teach]`. Quiz correct/wrong uses navy/red, not the teaching green.",
