  "thought": "The user wants me to implement styles.css based on an implementer brief. Let me follow the instructions carefully:\nI have the implementer brief and the existing index.html. I also have a good portion of the house style CSS. The user wants me to write a complete styles.css. Let me also look at:\nLet me read the BUILD-PLAN.md brand section more thoroughly, and also check changelog.html, appUpdates.js for toast class names, feedback.js for classes, and changelog.html for classes used. I also ne...I have a comprehensive picture now. Let me also look at the rest of uiModal.js for modal-actions, and check if there's a toast class already used. The brief lists `.toast` as a required class.\n```css\n/* styles.css — Homerun Practice App */\n\n/* =============================================\n   HOUSE-STYLE BANNER\n   ============================================= */\n /* \n  * 2026-08-20T03-09-55\n  * Visual envelope for Homerun Practice\n  * Token-driven, accessible, responsive, print 1:1\n  */\n\n/* =============================================\n   :root TOKENS\n   ============================================= */\n:root {\n  /* Brand palette */\n  --brand-navy: #062448;\n  --brand-navy-2: #14294d;\n  --brand-red: #a3301f;\n  --brand -red-2: #8d2418;\n  --cream: #f6f3ec;\n  --white: #ffffff;\n\n  /* Teaching colours (used only for field-diagram accents) */\n  --accent-rookie: #dc2626;\n  --accent-sandlot: #facc 15;\n  --accent-diamond: #16a34a;\n  --accent-select: #0d9488;\n  --accent-elite: #ea580c;\n  --accent-promind: #374151;\n\n  /* Tier accent tokens — navy through red progression, white-text safe */\n  --tier -rookie: #0a3d6b;\n  --tier-sandlot: #062448;\n  --tier-diamond: #14294d;\n  --tier-select: #5c2438;\n  --tier-elite: #8d2418;\n  --tier-promind: # a3301f;\n\n  /* Typography */\n  --font-stack: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n  --font-size-base: 1rem;\n  --font-size-h1: 2.25rem;\n  --font-size-h 2: 1.75rem;\n  --font-size-h3: 1.375rem;\n  --font-size-h4: 1.125rem;\n  --font-size-small: 0.875rem;\n  --line-height-base: 1.5;\n  --line-height-tight:  1.25;\n\n  /* Spacing */\n  --spacing-xs: 0.25rem;\n  --spacing-sm: 0.5rem;\n  --spacing-md: 1rem;\n  --spacing-lg: 1.5rem;\n  --spacing-xl: 2rem;\n  --spacing- 2xl: 3rem;\n\n  /* Breakpoints */\n  --breakpoint-xs: 360px;\n  --breakpoint-sm: 640px;\n  --breakpoint-md: 768px;\n  --breakpoint-lg: 1024px;\n  --breakpoint-xl: 1280px;\n\n  /* Shadows */\n  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n  --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px  4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n  --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 4px 6px -2px rgba (0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n\n  /* Z-index */\n  --z-toast: 9999;\n  --z-modal: 10000;\n  --z-nav: 100;\n}\n\n/* =============================================\n   RESET & BASE\n   ============================================= */\n*,\n*::before ,\n*::after {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nhtml {\n  font-size: 100%;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--font-stack);\n  font-size: var(--font-size-base);\n  line-height: var(--line-height-base);\n  color: var (--brand-navy);\n  background-color: var(--cream);\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n}\n\nbody.reduced-motion *,\nbody.reduced-motion *::before,\nbody.reduced-motion *::after {\n  animation-duration: 0.01ms !important ;\n  animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n  transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n  scroll-behavior: auto !important;\n}\n\n/* =============================================\n   FOCUS\n   ============================================= */\n:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--brand-red);\n  outline-offset:  2px;\n}\n\n.app-bar :focus-visible,\n.hero :focus-visible,\n.nav-btn:focus-visible,\n.btn:focus-visible,\n.btn-primary:focus-visible,\n.btn-accent:focus-visible,\n.btn-ghost:focus-visible {\n  outline-color: var(--brand-cream);\n}\n\n/* =============================================\n   SKIP LINK\n   ============================================= */\n.skip -link {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -40px;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--brand-navy);\n  color: var(--brand-cream);\n  padding: var(--spacing-md);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  z-index: 100;\n}\n\n.skip-link:focus {\n  top: 0;\n  width: auto;\n  height: auto;\n}\n\n/* =============================================\n   APP BAR\n   ============================================= */\n.app-bar {\n  position: sticky;\n  top: 0;\n  z-index: var(--z -nav);\n  background-color: var(--brand-navy);\n  color: var(--brand-cream);\n  padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  min-height: 64px;\n}\n\n.app-logo {\n display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.app-bar-title {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-h4);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.app-bar-sub {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-small);\n  opacity : 0.85;\n}\n\n.app-nav {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.nav-btn {\n  min-height: 44px;\n  min-width: 44px;\n  padding: 0 var(--spacing-md);\n  border: none;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--brand-cream);\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: inherit;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  transition: all 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.nav-btn:hover {\n  background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n color: var(--brand-white);\n}\n\n.nav-btn.active {\n  background-color: var(--brand-cream);\n  color: var(--brand-navy);\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.nav-btn-readme {\n  background-color: var(--brand-navy);\n  color: var(--brand-cream);\n}\n\n.app-footer {\n  background-color: var(--brand-navy);\n  color: var(--brand-cream);\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-md);\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: var(--font-size-small);\n}\n\n/* =============================================\n   VIEWS\n   ============================================= */\n.view {\n  display: none;\n  max-width: 1100px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  background-color: var(--cream);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n}\n\n.view.active {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n/* Home view special case — hero full bleed */\n#view-home.view.active {\n  padding: 0;\n  background: transparent;\n  border: none;\n  max-width: none;\n}\n\n/* =============================================\n   HERO\n   ============================================= */\n.hero {\n  position: relative;\n  background-color: var(--brand-navy);\n  background-image: url(\"brand/diamond-golden-hour.jpg\");\n  background-size: cover;\n  background-position: center;\n  color: var(--brand-cream);\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify -content: center;\n  text-align: center;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.hero::before {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    to bottom,\n    rgba(6, 36, 72, 0.82),\n    rgba (6, 36, 72, 0.88)\n  );\n  z-index: 0;\n}\n\n.hero::after {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background-image: url(\"brand/pattern-brand-tile.jpg\");\n  background-repeat: repeat;\n  opacity: 0.08;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.hero-inner {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n  max-width: 1100px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 0 var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.hero-crest {\n width: 96px;\n  height: 96px;\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.hero-title {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-h1);\n  margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-md);\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.hero-motto {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-h4);\n  margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-xl);\n  opacity: 0.9;\n}\n\n.hero-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n/* =============================================\n CONTINUE CARD\n  ============================================= */\n.continue-card {\n  background-color: var(--brand-white);\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n/* =============================================\n TIER RAIL\n  ============================================= */\n.tier-rail {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n .tier-rail-item {\n  flex: 1 1 140px;\n  min-width: 0;\n  background-color: var(--brand-white);\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  padding: var(--spacing-md);\n  text -align: center;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n}\n\n.tier-rail-item.tier-rookie { background-color: var(--tier-rookie); color: var(--brand-white); }\n.tier-rail-item.tier-sandlot { background-color: var(--tier-sandlot); color : var(--brand-white); }\n.tier-rail-item.tier-diamond { background-color: var(--tier-diamond); color: var(--brand-white); }\n.tier-rail-item.tier-select { background-color: var(--tier-select); color: var(--brand-white); }\n.tier-rail-item .tier-elite { background-color: var(--tier-elite); color: var(--brand-white); }\n.tier-rail-item.tier-promind { background-color: var(--tier-promind); color: var(--brand-white); }\n\n.tier-rail-item .tier-name {\n  font-weight: 700 ;\n  font-size: var(--font-size-h4);\n}\n\n.tier-rail-item .tier-desc {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-small);\n  opacity: 0.85;\n}\n\n/* =============================================\n QUICK LINKS\n  ============================================= */\n.I have a thorough picture. Coachnote is \"aside, cream card\". Example is worked scenario. Terms are dotted-underline buttons that open a glossary popover.\n```css\n:root {\n  /* Brand tokens */\n  --color-brand-navy: #062448;\n  --color-brand-navy-light: #14294d;\n  --color-brand-red: #a3301f;\n  --color-brand-red-dark: #8d2418;\n  --color-brand-cream : #f6f3ec;\n\n  /* Teaching colours (field diagrams only) */\n  --teach-ball: #dc2626;\n  --teach-base: #facc15;\n  --teach-backup: #16a34a;\n  --teach-unit-if: #0d948 8;\n  --teach-unit-of: #ea580c;\n  --teach-battery: #374151;\n\n  /* Typography */\n  --font-stack: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n  --text-xs: 0. 75rem;\n  --text-sm: 0.875rem;\n  --text-base: 1rem;\n  --text-lg: 1.125rem;\n  --text-xl: 1.25rem;\n  --text-2xl: 1.5rem;\n  --text-3xl : 1.875rem;\n  --text-4xl: 2.25rem;\n  --text-5xl: 3rem;\n  --text-6xl: 3.75rem;\n  --text-7xl: 4.5rem;\n\n  /* Spacing */\n  --space 0: 0;\n  --space-0.5: 0.125rem;\n  --space-1: 0.25rem;\n  --space-2: 0.5rem;\n  --space-3: 0.75rem;\n  --space-4: 1rem ;\n  --space-5: 1.25rem;\n  --space-6: 1.5rem;\n  --space-8: 2rem;\n  --space-12: 3rem;\n  --space-16: 4rem;\n  --space-24: 6rem ;\n  --space-32: 8rem;\n\n  /* Radius */\n  --radius: 0.5rem;\n  --radius-sm: 0.375rem;\n  --radius-md: 0.75rem;\n\n  /* Shadows */\n  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);\n  --shadow: 0 1px 3px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 1px 2px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1 );\n  --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 2px 4px -2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);\n  --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 4px 6px -4px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.The file is written. The user asked me not to run any shell commands. I should verify the file by reading it back (Read is allowed) to make sure it's complete and I can accurately report all custom pr...I have a complete inventory. Let me also verify all requested classes from the brief are present. Let me go through the brief list:\n",
